cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this corpus, please cite it as below."
title: "FieldBench Corpus: A Cross-Domain Benchmark for Schema-Driven Document Extraction"
abstract: >-
  A cross-domain, field-level benchmark for schema-driven document extraction
  (document to structured JSON): 1,442 documents across 10 categories with
  per-field ground truth, released so extraction-accuracy claims are falsifiable
  and comparable. Includes real documents from public sources and synthetic
  documents, each labeled by source, with a datasheet documenting composition,
  provenance, and per-source licensing.
type: dataset
